# Supabase in Next.js

- Use `@supabase/ssr` with separate browser + server clients
- Refresh session in `middleware.ts`
- Env vars: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
- Never expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` to client components
- Protect `app/(dashboard)/**`; redirect unauthenticated users to `/login`
- Gate dashboard: user must own a club OR be admin

Prefer Server Components for initial fetch; client components for forms/interactions.
Use React Query for client-side cache + mutations.
